# Personal global Git excludes (core.excludesFile).
# Keep project-specific or team-shared rules in the repository's .gitignore.
#
# Sources:
# - macOS + Vim templates: https://www.toptal.com/developers/gitignore/api/macos,vim
# - Claude Code settings: https://code.claude.com/docs/en/settings
# - Claude Code memory: https://code.claude.com/docs/en/memory
# - Codex config: https://developers.openai.com/codex/config-basic/
# - Codex instructions: https://developers.openai.com/codex/guides/agents-md/

### macOS ###
# Generated metadata and resource forks.
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride

# macOS volume icon (gitignore.io emits this with a CR suffix).
Icon

# Thumbnails / resource forks.
._*

# Files that might appear in the root of a volume.
.DocumentRevisions-V100
.fseventsd
.Spotlight-V100
.TemporaryItems
.Trashes
.VolumeIcon.icns
.com.apple.timemachine.donotpresent

# Directories potentially created on remote AFP shares.
.AppleDB
.AppleDesktop
Network Trash Folder
Temporary Items
.apdisk

### macOS Patch ###
# iCloud generated files.
*.icloud

### Neovim / Vim ###
# Swap files.
[._]*.s[a-v][a-z]
!*.svg
[._]*.sw[a-p]
[._]s[a-rt-v][a-z]
[._]ss[a-gi-z]
[._]sw[a-p]

# Sessions and editor temporary files.
Session.vim
Sessionx.vim
.netrwhist
*~

# Auto-generated tag files.
tags

# Persistent undo files.
[._]*.un~

### Claude Code (Anthropic) ###
# Personal per-project files. Claude Code documents these as gitignored local state.
**/.claude/settings.local.json
**/CLAUDE.local.md

### Codex (OpenAI) ###
# Personal project-level overrides. Force-add if a repository deliberately shares one.
**/AGENTS.override.md

# Optional local Codex TUI logs (the official docs use this path in an example).
.codex-log/

### Local tooling ###
# Oh My OpenAgent per-session coordination state.
.omo/run-continuation/
